global.dialog=1;
sCinema(oBarkley,"dialog","Genie:\\Hmph, these Duergars think they have the right to eat dunkaroos. Don't they realize we genies were rubbed out of magical lamps? What fools, to even begin to believe that they have the same civil rights as genies. Duergars are simply a means to an end and that end is precious chups for Square Enix Goya.",0);
